      "name": "Pod vs freelancer vs agency vs offshore GCC | Quantocos Global Systems LLP",
      "description": "Compare a GCA3 pod with a freelancer, an agency and an offshore GCC: cost, time to first output, management load, tools, continuity, security and the hidden costs.",
      "isPartOf": {
